  "description": "GRAVEL STARTS HERE. The new MACINA GRAVELATOR HX makes entering the world of e-gravel easier than ever. It combines the versatility and sporty ride feel of the GRAVELATOR family with electric assistance and an exceptionally attractive price-performance ratio. Support comes from the new Bosch Hub Line, delivering up to 45 Nm of torque and 400 watts of power. The lightweight hub motor integrates discreetly into the rear wheel, preserving the clean look and agile character of a classic gravel bike. Its smooth, natural assistance kicks in exactly when extra power is needed – on climbs, over long distances, or when you decide to take just one more turn. The balanced GRAVELATOR geometry provides a riding position that is both sporty and comfortable. Generous tire clearance and a modern frame design make the MACINA GRAVELATOR HX a versatile companion for asphalt, gravel, and everything in between.",
